cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the paper below."
title: "Stretcher: deformation-robust keypoint descriptors"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation of Stretcher, which improves keypoint matching under
  soft-tissue deformation by learning how descriptors change under local affine
  strain and applying that transformation in latent space.
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/constiwitzleben/Stretchers"
